9. Business Interpretation
Metric	Value (RF)	Interpretation
Recall (Bad)	~0.75	Catches 75% of actual defaulters
Precision (Bad)	~0.60	60% of flagged applicants actually default
ROC-AUC	~0.85	Strong discrimination power
Threshold tuning: Lower threshold → catch more defaulters (higher recall) but reject more good customers.
